[en.FOCUS_C02_PATH_TO_FREEDOM]
Detour to Independence

[en.FOCUS_C02_PATH_TO_FREEDOM_desc]
Even though Trixie was satisfied with the level of autonomy the Duchy of Ponyville had, Trixie, Cozy Glow, and the Resistance all knew that this situation could not last. The Duchy of Ponyville would either have to become fully independent, or be fully annexed into the Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PATH_TO_FREEDOM]
独立漫漫路

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PATH_TO_FREEDOM_desc]
虽然特丽克西对小马谷公爵领的自主程度还比较满意，但无论是特丽克西，和煦光流，还是抵抗组织，都很清楚，这种状况不可能持续下去。小马谷公爵领要么完全独立，要么彻底被并入帝国。

